{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1061609-rites-du-cheval-\u00bfhow-can-we-fix-them","id":1061609,"title":"Rites Du Cheval... \u00bfhow can we fix them?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-12T14:23:17-07:00","id":1061609,"title":"Rites Du Cheval... \u00bfhow can we fix them?","content":"I have been re-reading <i>Spirit Slayers</i>, and as far I understand this is how they work: each rite demand a ceremony (which may last hours) preferibly performed in a sacred space, the correct appeasement for the spirit, and a roll of Presence + Expression. After that the effect usually persist for a single scene.<br /> The obvious problem is, of course, <i>functionality: </i>isn\u00b4t likely that the 4.5 feet tall killing machine will sit down patiently in a corner while the hunter summons the power to boost his armor. Also, what about being able to benefit from several rites at once (Urathas are a bit hard to kill).<br /> .<br /> Any ideas to make them more...versatile?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 03-12-2017, 05:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-12T14:40:31-07:00","id":1061612,"title":"","content":"well, I have made a number of alternative systems for that Endowment in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/695939-the-civil-war-when-conspiracies-fall?p=913350#post913350\">here</a>. Maybe you'll find one of them as useful.",